rovides certified solutions for every major cooling system.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full flex items-center shadow-lg transition duration-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.404c0 6.556-5.332 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.013 0-3.987-.512-5.735-1.483l-6.249 1.708zm6.303-4.463c1.554.92 3.402 1.403 5.284 1.403 5.614 0 10.185-4.571 10.185-10.185 0-2.719-1.059-5.277-2.983-7.201s-4.482-2.983-7.202-2.983c-5.614 0-10.185 4.571-10.185 10.185 0 1.957.561 3.864 1.623 5.513l-1.066 3.89 3.987-1.091z\"/></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Gujarat Helpline\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-500 transition duration-300\">\n                        Gujarat Price List\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 flex justify-center\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Atlas-aircon-vehicle.webp\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon AC Repair Gujarat Fleet\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-8 border-yellow-400 transform rotate-2\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase tracking-wide\">Why Choose <b>Atlas Aircon</b> for AC Repair in Gujarat</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-orange-700\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-yellow-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        Gujarat Service Benefits\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li><b>Wide network</b> covering all major Gujarat cities and GIDC hubs.</li>\n                        <li><b>Certified technicians</b> specialized in multi-brand cooling systems.</li>\n                        <li><b>Original spare parts</b> sourced directly from manufacturers.</li>\n                        <li><b>Transparent pricing</b> linked to our official Gujarat price list.</li>\n                        <li><b>Rapid response</b> for industrial breakdowns and urgent residential calls.</li>\n                        <li><b>Heavy-duty maintenance</b> for large chillers and centralized ACs.</li>\n                        <li><b>State-wide warranty</b> valid across all our Gujarat service centers.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-orange-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-blue-900\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-orange-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n                        AC Service Risks\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>Gujarat dust storms lead to <b>heavy coil clogging</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Lack of regular service causes <b>extreme energy wastage</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Low gas levels result in <b>permanent compressor overheating</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Duplicate spare parts cause <b>short-term PCB failure</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Unprofessional installation leads to <b>constant water leakage</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Old capacitors result in <b>sudden fan motor burnouts</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Delaying service leads to <b>expensive replacement costs</b>.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Gujarat Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Expert cooling maintenance for residential and industrial sectors across Gujarat.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Window-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Window AC Repair Gujarat\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/window-ac-service-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Window AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Complete <b>window ac repair</b> including gas refill and motor work.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-service-gujarat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Gujarat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/chiller-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Chiller Repair Gujarat\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Chiller Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Heavy-duty <b>chiller maintenance</b> for industrial plants.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-gujarat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Gujarat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Repair Gujarat\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Panel AC Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Reliable <b>panel ac service</b> for industrial electrical cabinets.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-gujarat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Gujarat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-16 h-16 text-yellow-500 mb-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"></path></svg>\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/split-ac-service-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Split AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Premium <b>split ac repair</b> and master service washing.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/split-ac-service-gujarat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Gujarat</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Brands Gujarat -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase\">Multi-Brand AC Service Center Gujarat</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"/blue-star-ac-service-center-gujarat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Blue Star</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-gujarat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Daikin</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/samsung-ac-service-center-gujarat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Samsung</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/lg-ac-service-center-gujarat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">LG</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/voltas-ac-service-center-gujarat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Voltas</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/carrier-ac-service-center-gujarat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Carrier</b></a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Gujarat Price Table -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-orange-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">AC Repair Price List Gujarat</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border-t-8 border-orange-500\">\n                <table class=\"min-w-full leading-normal\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-900 text-yellow-400\">\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Service Detail (Gujarat)</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Estimated Cost</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Check Online</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Split AC Jet Service</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹599</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full Price List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Gas Refill (Gujarat Cities)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹2500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full Price List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>PCB Troubleshooting</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹1200</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full Price List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/remote/\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">AC Remote</a>\n                <a href=\"/capacitor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Capacitor</a>\n                <a href=\"/compressor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Compressor Fix</a>\n                <a href=\"/indoor-motor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Indoor Motor</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Gujarat Major Cities Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-yellow-400\">Our Service Presence Across Gujarat</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-ahmedabad\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Ahmedabad</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Vadodara</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Surat</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-rajkot\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Rajkot</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-anand\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Anand</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-bharcuh\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Bharuch</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-daman\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Daman</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-valsad\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Valsad</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-vapi\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Vapi</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-gandhinagar\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Gandhinagar</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-jamnagar\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Jamnagar</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-bhavnagar\" class=\"p-4 border border-blue-700 rounded text-center hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-blue-900 transition font-bold\">Bhavnagar</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-12 text-center text-blue-200\">\n                Also serving Kheda, Morbi, Godhra, Rajpipla, Mehsana, and all major GIDC belts.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Gujarat FAQs -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Gujarat Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the cost of AC service in Gujarat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our <b>ac jet service</b> starts from ₹599. We offer standardized pricing across Gujarat to ensure fairness and quality.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you provide AC repair across all Gujarat cities?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a network of <b>fast ac repair</b> centers covering Ahmedabad, Vadodara, Surat, Rajkot, and many more towns.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you handle industrial cooling for Gujarat GIDC hubs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides specialized <b>hvac repair services</b> for industrial plants in all major GIDC areas like Makarpura, Vatva, and Dahej.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What brands of AC do you repair in Gujarat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for all leading brands including Daikin, LG, Samsung, Blue Star, Voltas, and Hitachi.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Is gas charging available for commercial units?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>ac gas charging</b> for all systems including split, cassette, and package units using R32, R410, and R22 gas.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you provide original spare parts state-wide?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we strictly use <b>genuine ac spare parts</b> to ensure the longevity and efficiency of your air conditioner.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does a standard Gujarat service call take?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A typical <b>ac service</b> call takes about 60 to 90 minutes. Industrial visits may take longer depending on system size.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer AMC for corporate offices in Gujarat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>annual maintenance contracts</b> (AMC) for offices and industrial complexes across the state.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you repair cold rooms and deep freezers?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide expert <b>cold room repair services</b> and commercial refrigerator maintenance throughout Gujarat.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How do I book an Atlas Aircon technician?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Simply click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> on our hero banner or call our Gujarat helpline at <b>+91 97272 57141</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white py-12 border-t-4 border-yellow-400\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Gujarat\" class=\"h-12 mb-6\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-yellow-100\">Professional <b>AC repair Gujarat</b> and industrial cooling experts. Reliable cooling solutions across the state.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Gujarat Helpline</h4>\n                <p class=\"mb-2\">Call: +91 97272 57141</p>\n                <p>Corporate Office: Vadodara, Gujarat</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">City Links</h4>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-yellow-100\">\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-ahmedabad\" class=\"hover:underline\">Ahmedabad</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\" class=\"hover:underline\">Vadodara</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\" class=\"hover:underline\">Surat</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-rajkot\" class=\"hover:underline\">Rajkot</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"border-t border-blue-800 mt-12 pt-8 text-center text-blue-200 text-sm italic\">\n            &copy; 2024 Atlas Aircon. Dedicated AC Service in Gujarat.\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>",
